<description>&lt;p&gt;Haitian security forces have retaken the national stadium after two years of gang control, while Salvadoran missiles and ground forces struck a gang hideout, destroying the Mawozo headquarters and killing about 20 gang members. The UN chief condemned an attack that killed 47 people and the United Nations reported more than 1,000 deaths between July and September. Haitian police killed a gang leader and intensified operations against other sites, and kidnappings in the capital rose in the third quarter. 193 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168782&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNa3JmQ2JoTVpvbFdHQUdCMmh3STBtbGllTTNxMmdHTGZ0djZadF9xd3dlTFNvSDhtbXlrelB5My13Q1NxdTJFWlMzdmFHTmpla1dhZG1xMXgtLWJIV2paWkRIRkNNVkpSVkNfbTFCVzZfaS1nSWxqMl9mZVNCR01sYXExOHVsVTR3dGZwdk02cmtiRDdNa1dCbk5kYmxEak45Ync?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE02UTdNT284eHRpaFBYa1puUi1rc0VMbFQ4bE1sbFA3aG9ENlExcldXVVlyMk0yalQtM0NPbWhzNl9CUXpIQURMR2lQaFdRME1waldPWVZkOEJfUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOOHNfc2VLMFNEMnFQeURjTlg2aWJnUlN1dHJTUDI1cHdSR1RNakpzdjB4eEEwUDlyY0I5R29fTjVPWURxREE0WGc5WTV3U2FmaTNPeHVzUDY4a0RXMEE2cWUzNzQwWl81NWxZTnVLZVdJTk5pbm93dk5JY2V5TVZ3UDhuQlZza2hHQU02a09yWEU1TDV4cWRlYXp4VHlQUjdZZUpuWG56SW1MeGNzbHMxcUNQVk5iVXM?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxORkI0dEplVHVJWmVxWTVHRlFXRnNkLTVvWHdQWmNzYUR1ZWx6OGtYZnVnWW1BZzRnREFoT1RQcm1SZDJtNFN5M1ZySm5x